    <string name="accident_step_1">Turn on the hazard lights. If the car can move, pull over to a safe place. On a highway, get out and wait behind the guardrail.</string>
    <string name="accident_step_2">If anyone is hurt, call 119. To report the accident, call 112.</string>
    <string name="accident_step_3">Call your rental company. The number is on your contract.</string>
    <string name="accident_step_4">Take photos of both cars and the road only if it is safe. Do not stay on or go back onto the road to take photos.</string>
